{"id":"vod_bf_16822","vodId":"16822","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"进击的巨人第一季","name_cn":"进击的巨人第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-18/4b89642389895f16f5a28e4780ce7a9a.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个被巨人支配着的世界。成为巨人的食物的人类建造起了高达50米的巨大墙壁，以自由为代价去防止墙外的巨人的侵略。10岁的少年艾伦·耶格尔梦想着看到未知的墙外的世界。艾伦对那些满足于暂时的和平而放弃外出的人们感到格格不入。艾伦称他们为“家畜”。他们认为艾伦是“异物”。但是，由于能跨越墙壁的超大型巨人的出现，艾伦的“梦想”和人们的“和平”都瞬间土崩瓦解了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:49:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendiyiji/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.c